From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:54:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Item slots for WASM block entities (API block 2)

container-spec in block-entity-kind, item-stack, items in block-entity and
block-entity-update; the game builds the container table when server mods
appear; block-mover example and harness support (set-items, block-items).
